# ---------------------------------------------------------------- deal data
# This repository is PUBLIC. Everything below is either a real person's data or
# our own outreach infrastructure, and neither belongs in it. The CODE is the
# shareable part; what it produces is not.
#
# Deal deliverables and research packs name real owners and heirs, carry their
# addresses, phone numbers and in the probate work their dates of death. A
# public commit of that is not undoable: forks, caches and archives keep it
# after any later deletion.
*.xlsx
*_Deep_Prospecting.md
*_Deep_Prospecting.pdf
*_Outreach.csv
*contacts*.csv
walk_*.json
*_boundary.json

# Property photos and video from walkthroughs (141MB, and they show real homes).
